        "image_mask": "square",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Join Us on the Adventure of a Lifetime!",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Seize this rare opportunity to join an intimate group of Gaians and <strong>Erich von Däniken</strong> on an expedition that unveils the layers of Ancient Egyptian history like you’ve never been told before.</p><p><br/>On this extraordinary tour of Egypt, you will embark on a quest to explore Egypt pre-10,500 BC, a time when an advanced, little-known civilization thrived in this land. Däniken, <strong>world-renowned expert on ancient civilizations</strong>, will join you  March 19 - 27 and offer <strong>nightly Q&A discussions</strong> that few are privileged to encounter!<br/><br/>As you venture forth and explore this ancient world, the evidence becomes clearer and more compelling. This civilization, though now lost to the ages, left behind enduring remnants of their existence. It was as if they vanished, leaving their legacy to be discovered by those who would come later. Are you going to be one of them? </p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "50",
        "layout": "right",
        "color_scheme": "none",
