        "57393d7c-eaea-43e6-934b-e35643791451": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 1: Welcome to Cairo",
            "text": "<p>On arrival at Cairo Airport, you’ll meet your tour guide and be transferred to your hotel, with time to relax afterwards.  Refreshed and ready to embark on your quest to explore prehistoric Egypt, you’ll join your fellow explorers for an introductory meeting and preview of what's to come.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/egypt-tour-day-1-1200x800.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><strong>Inclusions:</strong></p><ul><li>Accommodations at Marriott Mena House Hotel</li><li>Transfer from airport to hotel</li><li>Welcome Dinner</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "46f98c92-e505-4141-a9a0-fa35c3e1337c": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 2: Giza Plateau",
            "text": "<p>Today we are taking you on a day tour of the renowned Giza Plateau, where you'll stand in awe before the Great Pyramids of Giza, marvel at the mysteries of the Valley Temple, and encounter the majestic Sphinx. Then, step into the hallowed halls of the Egyptian Museum in Cairo, home to the famed treasures of Tutankhamun. </p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Giza_Plateau.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li>Visit Giza Plateau</li><li>Visit the Valley temple</li><li>Private visit to the enclosure of the Sphinx</li><li>Visit the Museum in Cairo</li></ul><p><strong>Inclusions</strong></p><ul><li>Breakfast and Lunch</li><li>Transport to and from Cairo</li><li>Accommodations at Marriott Mena House Hotel</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "af9886df-0842-456c-a4da-f86a8fae9128": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 3: Sakkara/Dashur",
            "text": "<p>Today we are taking a day trip to explore the iconic Step Pyramid Complex! Traverse the enigmatic Southern Shaft, then venture to the majestic Red Pyramid. Finally, we'll take you to the Bent Pyramid, steeped in architectural intrigue and mesmerizing tales. </p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Red_Pyramid.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li>Visit the Step Pyramid Complex</li><li>Go under the Step Pyramid</li><li>Visit the Southern Shaft</li><li>Visit the Serapeum </li><li>Visit the Red Pyramid</li><li>Visit the Bent Pyramid</li></ul><p><strong>Inclusions</strong></p><ul><li>Breakfast and lunch</li><li>Transport to Sakkara and Dahshur</li><li>Accommodations at Marriott Mena House Hotel</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "665f407f-c58f-4cfe-8e14-b0c7e48b8013": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 4: Luxor/ Karnak Temple",
            "text": "<p>Today will take you on a captivating exploration of the legendary Karnak Temple and to marvel at the Open Air Museum at Karnak. But that's not all – we'll also take you on a guided tour of the mystical Chapel of Seven Gates, offering a glimpse into ancient rituals and beliefs.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Karnak.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li>Visit Karnak Temple</li><li>Visit the Open-Air Museum at Karnak</li><li>Visit the Chapel of 7 Gates</li><li>Free evening (or enjoy a Nile cruise on a felucca)</li></ul><p><strong>Inclusions</strong></p><ul><li>Breakfast, lunch, and dinner</li><li>Transport to Cairo and accommodation</li><li>Flight to Luxor</li><li>Accommodations at Jolie Ville Luxor Resort</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "a0ac19a9-eb3f-4293-b194-c7a3b463e4f6": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 5: Dendera-Abydos",
            "text": "<p>Immerse yourself in the divine beauty of the Hathor Temple, dedicated to the goddess of love and music. Explore the majestic Abydos Temple, an ancient marvel that houses exquisite reliefs and captivating hieroglyphics. You will also do a private visit to the enigmatic Osirion Temple, believed to be the burial place of the revered god Osiris, built before 10,500 BC.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Hathor_Temple.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li>Visit Hathor Temple</li><li>Visit Abydos Temple</li><li>Private visit to the Osirion Temple</li></ul><p><strong>Inclusions: </strong></p><ul><li>Breakfast, lunch, and dinner</li><li>Transport to and from Dendra</li><li>Accommodations at Jolie Ville Luxor Resort</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "356bfe06-89e2-457a-a782-ada1263e0d36": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 6: West Bank",
            "text": "<p>Today we will delve into the mysteries of the Valley of the Kings, where the tombs of pharaohs stand testament to a majestic past. Then, get ready to explore the magnificent Ramesseum Temple. Witness skilled artisans at work in the Alabaster Factory, and finally, you will behold the towering Colossi of Memnon.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Ramesseum_Temple.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li>Visit the Valley of the Kings</li><li>Special access to the tomb of Rekhmire</li><li>Visit the Ramesseum Temple</li><li>Visit the Colossi of Memnon </li><li>Visit Luxor Temple</li></ul><p><strong>Inclusions: </strong></p><ul><li>Breakfast, lunch, and dinner</li><li>Transport to the West Bank of Luxor and back</li><li>Accommodations at Jolie Ville Luxor Resort</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "66db8b2b-fdc9-4434-bd63-38c72353b779": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 7: Cairo",
            "text": "<p>Explore the hallowed halls of the Egyptian Museum in Cairo. Then, as a highlight, experience the ultimate privilege with a private visit inside the Great Pyramid of Giza. Step into the chambers of this awe-inspiring monument, basking in the mystical aura of its millennia-old secrets.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Great_Pyramid_2.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li>Visit The Egyptian Museum in Cairo</li><li>Private visit inside the Great Pyramid</li></ul><p><strong>Inclusions: </strong></p><ul><li>Breakfast and lunch</li><li>Transport to airport and flight to Cairo</li><li>Accommodations at Marriott Mena House Hotel</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dd20cdd8-6dc0-42a2-91c4-c110a0716601": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 8: Cairo",
            "text": "<p>Departure</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Great_Pyramid.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><strong>Inclusions: </strong></p><ul><li>Breakfast </li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
