    "05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286": {
      "type": "text-with-icons",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-1": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "What accommodations should I expect?",
            "text": "<p>During your Egypt trip, you can expect tried and tested 5-star accommodations every night of your trip.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-3": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "What's the difference between Double and Single?",
            "text": "<p>Single occupancy means you will have your own room at all accommodations during trip. Double occupancy means you will share a room with another tour participant at all accommodations during trip. You will be paired up with your most likely best match based on the tour group.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-4": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "Do I need to have a vaccine to travel to Egypt?",
            "text": "<p>No inoculations are necessary when arriving in Egypt. Consult with your health care provider before traveling.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-5": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "Do you cater for Vegetarians or Vegans?",
            "text": "<p>The high end hotels and restaurants we will be visiting serve a variety of Egyptian and Western dishes with plenty of vegetarian options and some vegan options.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20197640634689__05a6ccb4-5008-4aea-bd7b-71a71b3b7286-text_block-7": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "What service can I expect when traveling with Mohamed Ibrahim?",
            "text": "<p>Mohamed Ibrahim and his company Saba Tours was established 15 years ago and is a member of the Egyptian Travel Agents Association (E.T.A.A)  the International Air Transport Association (IATA). You can expect a professional team with a high level of experience in the field of tourism and touring.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
